<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/00d0c5267660> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8088] Samantha Koziara, communications manager at the Ottawa Food Bank, told The Verge in a statement." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8088" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0120776a9396> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6445] Late last week, MSN.com's Microsoft Travel section posted an AI-generated article about the \"cannot miss\" attractions of Ottawa that includes the Ottawa Food Bank" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6445" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/06a9dcae9874> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6445] Since the announcement of deep investments and collaborations with ChatGPT-maker OpenAI in January and the emergence of Bing Chat the month after, Microsoft has been experimenting with integrating AI-generated content into its online publications and services" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6445" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/0bc676b920d5> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[6445] Late last week, MSN.com's Microsoft Travel section posted an AI-generated article about the \"cannot miss\" attractions of Ottawa that includes the Ottawa Food Bank" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6445" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/1090b4461c7b> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "[8088] Headed to Ottawa? Here's what you shouldn't miss! reads its title, written under the official byline of 'Microsoft Travel.'" ;
    airo:sourceDocId "8088" .

<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/14e95627bcd8> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "The article is credited to \"Microsoft Travel,\" and it is likely the product of a large language model (LLM), a type of AI model trained on a vast scrape of text found on the Internet." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "6445" .

